Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:59:38 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Background workers run below the game's own thread

The HD texture decoders and the pipeline prewarm ran at the same priority as the game and present threads, so on a computer with few cores
decoding a texture pack could take the CPU from the game and make it stutter. They now lower their own priority (below normal on Windows, nice 10 on Linux and
Android, utility QoS on macOS). <prefix>_WORKER_PRIORITY=0 leaves it as it was.
---
